  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>log</mi><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>⁡</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>2</mn></math> and <math><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>π</mi></math>, then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></math> lies in the interval",
